{_foo}
a bare boolean starting with an underscore is text

{disabled}
a bare boolean is an attribute block

{_k=1 _="on click"}
a key keeps its leading underscore

{#_id ._c}
an id and a class keep theirs too

[x]{_u} is text, [x]{_u=""} is a span

{_x_} is an underline, not an attribute

-{_k} x

-{k} x

1.{_k} x

1.{_k=1} x
